    "course_pol": "Attend the class as much as possible. Do your best in studying! If there is any other problems, all questions are welcomed to ask teachers! \nAttend the class as much as possible. Do your best in studying! If there is any other problems, all questions are welcomed to ask teachers!\nAttend the class as much as possible. Do your best in studying! If there is any other problems, all questions are welcomed to ask teachers!..",
